## Ticket System

Tickets are markdown files in `{{TASKS_DIR}}`, named `{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXX-description.md`.

- Letter-suffix children (`{{TICKET_PREFIX}}-XXXa/b/c`) are subtasks of a parent ticket; they consume
  no new ticket numbers.
- Status vocabulary: `TODO | IN_PROGRESS | BLOCKED | PLANNING | REVIEW | DONE`.
- `{{TASKS_DIR}}/.ticket_counter` holds the next number — committed, never hand-edited; on conflict
  take the higher number.
- Ordered work queue: `{{TASKS_DIR}}/TODO.md`. Backlog: `{{TASKS_DIR}}/BACKLOG.md`.
- Completed tickets are **moved** to `{{TASKS_DIR}}/archive/YYYY-MM/` — never deleted.
- Every task mutation lands as one scoped commit/push transaction (pull before read; stage exact
  paths, never `git add -A`).

Ticket creation and closure follow the WORKFLOW_POLICY block above.
